Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi there. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.43,0:00:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want a Wonder Egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? You're not sure yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:13.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:16.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have courage and believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has the thing you want in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has your wish in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you crack it in the Egg world...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and if you clear your mission...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a little warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might be able to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your loved one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first time's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:51.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, bring your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? How do we make the Eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.49,0:00:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a trade secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't just tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know: Let us tell you about our regular customers instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.86,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A group of four charming young girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's our story that no one else knows about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A story... that no one knows about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, and then make up your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about whether you'll bring home an Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't reality. It's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.27,0:01:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or, well, let's call it the "Egg world."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A world only people who've broken an Egg can connect to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:02:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strongly influenced by your mental landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And under certain conditions, you can\Nshare that world with other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:07.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You synchronized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fell asleep near each other\Nand at almost the same time, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why aren't we in my dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're pulled by whoever's feelings are stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:26.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Wonder Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:34.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you crack a Wonder Egg,\Na girl emerges from inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're girls who approached death \Nof their own will and left this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you will protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From Seeno Evils and Wonder Killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You ought to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get right to one of our regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.47,0:03:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her name is Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A 14-year-old with mismatched eye colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A middle-school second year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai! Your teacher is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to force her to get up, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When she met us, she wouldn't go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She says she was bullied for her heterochromia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not why she was skipping school, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:37.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you like games?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai's meeting with Nagase Koito, a new student \Nin her class, changed her destiny in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.\NYou shouldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get bullied for it.\NAlways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:21.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we could, I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She finally made a best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But one day, she lost her without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Classic harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would they do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you're my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say Mr. Sawaki is giving me special treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think they're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:55.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scared of being left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get the video?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:17.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were scared, huh?\NSorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.\NI know you tried your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase Koito committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why'd she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was Ai lacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who pushed Koito toward it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai is fighting to get back the best friend she lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done pretending not to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a part of me that resented her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were friends, so why didn't she talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:05:59.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she'd asked me to die with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:12.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd have...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mission's victory condition is to defeat a Wonder Killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:28.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}a symbol of the Egg girl's discord, obsession, or trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the Egg world, you're immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And your physical abilities dramatically increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be immortal, but watch out for injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you come back hurt, you'll end up like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aonuma Neiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's my contact info.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Message me when you want to change plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll buy Eggs on odd days; you buy them on even days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't have to meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru's a girl genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just 14,\Nbut she runs her own company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:13.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's calm, not very talkative, and not very outgoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This smells amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:26.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're trusting, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You forgive easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lovely that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless {\i1}and{\i0} lovely that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need someone like that \Nsometimes, or we'll never be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A capable woman actually spoils them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She seems to have taken to Ai, \Nbut she's a little too harsh on Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why are you looking at me?\N{\an8}Because it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an anachronistic fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "fool"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coochy-coochy-coo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, she has her charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They really get along, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of those "tsunderes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:17.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about this spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru is buying Eggs and fighting to get back her little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't like who you are now, so you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to change the self you hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go, but I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For someone selfish enough to... kill themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika, Neiru's trying to save her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:55.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sister stabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, she ran away and jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what they told me when I woke up in the ICU.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you've got even less of a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scar aches and keeps me awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the pain has faded since I started going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I try to forget her, my scar aches, like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:24.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls become adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The miraculous beauty of a butterfly emerging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:35.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're pretty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.03,0:09:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not die when you're at your most beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why cling to a meaningless life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you die?\NMirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror on the wall, who's the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:10:00.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Why don't I die," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You tempted me to die, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Experience gained in the Egg world \Nis directly reflected in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For example, as you run and jump \Nthere, your athleticism improves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:29.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like fighting there puts \Na heavy strain on our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:31.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like high-altitude training?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you mention it, I think\NI've gotten some definition on my abs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your wounds heal faster, too, \Nso heal up before you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might be a bit tough at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It takes practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going\Nto change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You can do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:03.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:09.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my fault!\NLeave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just want attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you really mean is that you\Nwant someone to find you and love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, I won't leave you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}can't{\i0} leave you alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's just abuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These aren't Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're Haters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done too much to stand out in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite created Haters\Nof you girls from among the Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't have the guts to show\Ntheir faces, but they do have madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're strong in groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe as strong as a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run or hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're after you: the "heroes" in the limelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:26.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hide here until the bell rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:30.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't clear the mission if you don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, focus on maintaining the status quo for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a solution in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:39.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Yae is hurt.\NIt's my fault she—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'll regenerate in as little as ten minutes in her Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:47.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, they found us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Protect the Egg girl until time runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's your top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Society is built on "report, contact, consult."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say it out loud and share it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our greatest objective is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:02.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Egg...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As we were saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this girl is Kawai Rika, a former junior idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.99,0:13:17.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember it as {\i1}Kawaii{\i0} Rika, since I'm so super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's talkative, excitable, and above all, greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you spot me cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NCome see me again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:40.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She may seem indomitable at first glance,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:43.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but her home life is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My daddy says a beautiful woman doesn't need a wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone will always offer to pay for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, he got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of these five is my real daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika doesn't know her real father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She obsesses over the father she's \Nnever met and dislikes her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.01,0:14:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm preeetty sure it's one of these guys, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll meet him someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.81,0:14:22.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl Rika wants to save is Chiemi,\Na fan from her junior idol days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My little wallet who'd buy me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiemi was a real idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She got in line for me dozens, maybe hundreds of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:01.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She just gave me all her allowance \Nand New Year's money with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:06.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believed I had a rich patron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:10.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I saw her shoplifting in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'd been selling what she stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally know that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:25.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got sugar daddies for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, I told her I'd never be friends with a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:35.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said I'd be too embarrassed to be\Nseen with a fatty in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said, "Never come back."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, another fan told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiemi died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was skin and bones, like a mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't forget her if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This...\NThis isn't Chiemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:59.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She regrets that something she said \Nended up driving Chiemi to her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why she fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll hit you with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rika?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's with those Haters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who asked them to treat us like\Nheroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not doing this for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.01,0:16:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you "had a solution in mind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Look, here it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That case contains things that will support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's what you call a "power up."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how do we use them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, you hatch them in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hatch them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go home and open them when you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They require imprinting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They see whoever meets their gaze first as their parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:56.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chant "{\i1}veni{\i0}" to call them from\Ntheir eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:57.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Redi{\i0}" to return them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haters are their favorite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite are their bread and butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:45.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And finally, there's Sawaki Momoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a tall, slender girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just one day, but I fell in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:56.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that I got to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:18:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She says she's often mistaken \Nfor a boy or gets asked out by girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, everything she says or does is cool and handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She might be the most "normal" of the four.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you. I don't want to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are more than you'd think, Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls like you, who say they love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl Momoe wants to save is Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.33,0:18:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She’s got complicated circumstances of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka was willing to see me as a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your friend who killed herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:18:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she suddenly took her clothes off in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She put the moves on you? Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:10.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got scared and ended up pushing her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.77,0:19:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:14.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Aren't you Mr. Sawaki's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawaki Momoe. I'm his niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a pretty young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And one of Momoe's relatives,\NSawaki Shuichiro, is Ai's teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll paint how you look to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:42.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When it's finished, I want you to have confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear Mr. Sawaki's entering it in the next exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to win a prize\Nand make a living as a painter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:51.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A painting of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If not, you should decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's future is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sawaki Shuichiro is disturbing Ai's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His relationship with Nagase Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His relationship with Ai's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen calmly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean that my uncle might have been\Ninvolved in Koito's suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll never know the truth \Nunless we bring Koito back and ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There might be a factor complicating matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NAi likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the truth were easy to find, no one would struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:51.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The human heart is difficult to fathom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:21:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like Ai's made up her mind to hunt down the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we'll have to see where that goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.85,0:21:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,going to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's pretty much how you use the Eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't seem too enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look as though you can't trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? After we broke it all down for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We protect these girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:45.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a women-only car!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a girl, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:21:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mannen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.11,0:22:11.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you've got to... protect your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.74,0:22:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Next, we'll tell you about ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Info about us'll cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:20.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, that's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drop in again if you want to hear more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mannen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you off your feet with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.39,0:22:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I protect a bunch more people, \Nwill Koito come back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She will, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.19,0:22:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
